Extra arguments to pass to the docker run command, like volume and port
mappings.

A `--restart` option is refused with `net_rules`: the engine
would restart the container by itself, with no network filter. om passes no
restart policy, and restarts the containers.

A `--cgroup-parent` or a `--cgroups` option is refused with it too: the
engine would place the container out of the slice om sets the network filter
on. om places the container in the slice of its process group.
